Dashboard widget listing the active DHCP leases of every running
DHCP server in a single table: ISC DHCP (v4/v6), Kea DHCP (v4/v6)
and Dnsmasq DHCP. Columns: IP address, hostname, MAC address,
interface, lease type, server and online status.

Inspired by the legacy dHCP_leases.widget.php by Tonton Jo.

Plugin Changelog
================

1.0.0

* Initial release for the JavaScript dashboard (OPNsense 24.7 and newer)
* Support for ISC DHCP, Kea DHCP and Dnsmasq DHCP
* Online status from ARP/NDP for Kea and Dnsmasq
* Optional IPv6 leases
